#. Description of the plugin
#: stripe-mobilepay-woocommerce.php
msgid "Unofficial MobilePay payment method for WooCommerce on your existing Stripe account (through the official WooCommerce Stripe Payment Gateway): reserved at checkout, captured when the order is completed. Requires the WooCommerce Stripe Payment Gateway plugin by WooCommerce (https://wordpress.org/plugins/woocommerce-gateway-stripe/), connected to your Stripe account: its API keys are used."
msgstr ""

